## PART 5 — Nominal yield decomposition

Retrieve matched-maturity nominal Treasury yields, TIPS real yields and breakeven inflation.

Construct:

`NOMINAL_YIELD_10Y(t) ≈ REAL_YIELD_10Y(t) + BREAKEVEN_10Y(t)`

And:

`ΔNOMINAL_YIELD_10Y ≈ ΔREAL_YIELD_10Y + ΔBREAKEVEN_10Y`

Use the decomposition to distinguish real-rate repricing from inflation-compensation repricing.

Recognize that this is an accounting relationship involving derived market measures.

Do not treat the decomposition itself as independent evidence of predictive power.

